---
layout: layout.njk
title: Sodeman Realty
description: Trusted guidance for first-time buyers and investment properties in Lansing, Michigan.
---

<section class="hero" aria-label="Hero">
  <div class="hero-bg" role="img" aria-label="Stylized Lansing skyline background"></div>
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy reveal">
      <h1>{{ site.hero_headline }}</h1>
      <p class="subheadline">{{ site.hero_subheadline }}</p>

      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="tel:{{ site.phone_tel }}">Call {{ site.phone_display }}</a>
        <a class="btn-secondary" href="{{ site.calendly_url }}">Schedule Consultation</a>
        <a class="btn-link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-row">
        <div class="trust-pill">First-time buyers</div>
        <div class="trust-pill">Investment properties</div>
        <div class="trust-pill">{{ site.service_area_short }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-figure reveal" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/assets/img/joel-cutout.webp" alt="" />
      <div class="hero-figure-tag">
        <div class="name">{{ site.broker }}</div>
        <div class="role">Broker, {{ site.name }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container section reveal">
  <h2>Structured guidance, conservative execution</h2>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Disciplined search</h3>
      <p>Define constraints, filter noise, and focus on properties that meet your plan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Offer strategy</h3>
      <p>Comparable analysis, risk controls, and negotiation aligned to your timeline.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Closing support</h3>
      <p>Inspection response and coordination to reduce surprises and protect outcomes.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container section reveal">
  <h2>Featured listings</h2>
  {% if listings.items and listings.items.length %}
    <p class="muted">Selected opportunities in the {{ site.service_area_short }} area.</p>
    <div class="listing-grid">
      {% for item in listings.items %}
        <a class="listing-card" href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          {% if item.image %}
            <img class="listing-img" src="{{ item.image }}" alt="" />
          {% else %}
            <div class="listing-img" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          {% endif %}
          <div class="listing-meta">
            <div class="listing-title">{{ item.title }}</div>
            <div class="listing-sub">{{ item.subtitle }}</div>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <div class="empty-panel">
      <p>Inventory moves quickly in Mid-Michigan. Rather than stale sample cards, Joel curates opportunities against your plan—price band, neighborhood, and use case.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn-primary" href="{{ site.calendly_url }}">Schedule a search consult</a>
        <a class="btn-outline" href="/listings/">How featured listings work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section class="container section reveal">
  <h2>How working together looks</h2>
  <p class="muted">A simple process designed for clarity under pressure.</p>
  {% include "process.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="container section reveal">
  <h2>Market updates</h2>
  <p class="muted">Notes on pricing discipline, inventory, and negotiation conditions in the Lansing area.</p>
  <a class="btn-outline" href="/blog/">Read market updates</a>
</section>
